    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -680,
        "y": -300
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Srivastava, Hinton, Krizhevsky, Sutskever and Salakhutdinov, \"Dropout: A Simple Way to Prevent Neural Networks from Overfitting\", JMLR 2014. Claim: randomly zeroing half of the hidden units during training keeps a large network from memorising a small training set, so it generalises better. Recipe: two identical 784-1024-1024-10 MLPs on 2,000 MNIST training images, SGD lr 0.01 with momentum 0.9 for 40 epochs, one with Dropout 0.5 after each hidden layer. Under seed 2 on a CPU both reach a training accuracy of 1.00; on the 10,000 test images the plain net scores 0.91 and the dropout net 0.93, so the train/test gap shrinks from 0.09 to 0.07.\n\nSrivastava、Hinton、Krizhevsky、Sutskever 與 Salakhutdinov，〈Dropout: A Simple Way to Prevent Neural Networks from Overfitting〉，JMLR 2014。論點：訓練時隨機把一半的隱藏單元歸零，大網路就沒辦法死背小訓練集，泛化能力因此變好。配方：兩個相同的 784-1024-1024-10 MLP，在 2,000 張 MNIST 訓練影像上用 SGD（lr 0.01、momentum 0.9）訓練 40 個 epoch，其中一個在每個隱藏層後面加 Dropout 0.5。在 CPU 上以種子 2 執行，兩者的訓練準確率都是 1.00；在 10,000 張測試影像上，一般網路得到 0.91，dropout 網路得到 0.93，訓練與測試的差距從 0.09 縮小到 0.07。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-data",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 1000,
        "y": -300
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "MNIST ships with the repository under backend/data, so the run reads it from disk. DatasetSplit keeps a fixed 2,000 of the 60,000 training images; its own seed (0) picks them, so every arm trains on the same images through the one DataLoader. A training set this small is what lets a 1.9-million-parameter MLP memorise it.\n\nMNIST 隨專案放在 backend/data 底下，執行時直接從磁碟讀取。DatasetSplit 從 60,000 張訓練影像中固定留下 2,000 張，挑哪幾張由它自己的種子（0）決定，所以每一組都透過同一個 DataLoader 在同一批影像上訓練。訓練集這麼小，190 萬個參數的 MLP 才有辦法把它背下來。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "dl-train",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 320,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-arms",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -300,
        "y": 400
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Each arm has its own SequentialModel node. One model node wired into two TrainingLoops would hand every loop the same weights, and each loop would continue from what the previous one left. The run seed (2, stored in the file) fixes the shuffle order, any dropout masks and each model's initial weights. Every node is seeded from the run seed and its own id, so the arms start from different draws of the same initialisation. With Persist weights between runs on (Settings > Training Behavior), a second Run continues from the trained weights; turn it off to repeat these numbers.\n\n每一組都有自己的 SequentialModel 節點。如果一個模型節點同時接到兩個 TrainingLoop，每個迴圈拿到的是同一份權重，後跑的會接著前一個留下的結果繼續訓練。執行種子（2，存在檔案裡）固定了洗牌順序、dropout 遮罩和每個模型的初始權重。每個節點的種子由執行種子和節點自己的 id 推得，所以各組的初始權重是同一種初始化方式下的不同抽樣。在設定 > 訓練行為中開啟「在多次執行間保留權重」時，第二次執行會從訓練過的權重繼續；關閉它才能重現這些數字。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "model-plain",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -340,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-model",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -300,
        "y": 1400
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Open the layer editor: Flatten -> Linear 784->1024 -> ReLU -> Dropout 0.5 -> Linear 1024->1024 -> ReLU -> Dropout 0.5 -> Linear 1024->10. The model above has the same layers without the two Dropout layers. EvaluateModel runs the model in eval mode, which switches dropout off, so the accuracies are those of the full network, as in the paper.\n\n打開圖層編輯器：Flatten -> Linear 784->1024 -> ReLU -> Dropout 0.5 -> Linear 1024->1024 -> ReLU -> Dropout 0.5 -> Linear 1024->10。上面那個模型的圖層相同，只是少了兩層 Dropout。EvaluateModel 以 eval 模式執行模型，dropout 會關閉，所以準確率是完整網路的表現，和論文的做法一樣。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "model-dropout",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -340,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-loss",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 1320,
        "y": -300
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The two loss plots: the plain net drives its training loss down to 0.005 by epoch 40, while the dropout net's ends at 0.06, because every step trains a different thinned network. Compare the four Print nodes: the training accuracies match, and the test accuracy is where the two nets differ.\n\n兩張損失圖：一般網路在第 40 個 epoch 把訓練損失壓到 0.005，dropout 網路則停在 0.06，因為每一步訓練的都是一個不同的瘦身網路。比較四個 Print 節點：訓練準確率相同，兩個網路的差別出現在測試準確率。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "dl-train",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 640,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    }
  ],
